l-fated Army buddy who is familiar with every recipe that involves shrimp; and the special effects artists whose digital magic place Forrest amidst a remarkable array of historical events and people.","genres":["Drama"]}],"info":[{"title":"Information","items":[{"title":"Studio","info":"Paramount Pictures"},{"title":"Released","info":"1994"},{"title":"Run Time","info":"2 hr 22 min"},{"title":"Rated","info":"PG-13 for sci-fi action violence/peril and a scene of sexual content."},{"title":"Content Advisories","info":"Sexual Content, Suggestive Dialogue, Fantasy Violence, Violence, Language"},{"title":"Region of Origin","info":"United States"},{"title":null,"info":"© 2004 Paramount Pictures"}]},{"title":"Languages","items":[{"title":"Original Audio","info":"English, French, French (France)"},{"title":"Audio","info":"English (AD, AAC, ⁨Dolby 5.1⁩, Dolby Atmos), Spanish (Latin America) (AAC, ⁨Dolby 5.1⁩)"},{"title":"Subtitles","info":"English (CC), Spanish (Latin America) "}]},{"title":"Accessibility","items":[{"title":"(cc)","info":"Closed captions (CC) refer to subtitles in the available language with the addition of relevant non-dialogue information."},{"title":"(ad)","info":"Audio descriptions (AD) refer to a narration track describing what is happening on screen, to provide context for those who are blind or have low vision."}]}]}